<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia's SFE January wheat futures higher.</title>
<headline>Australia's SFE January wheat futures higher.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>January wheat on the Sydney Futures Exchange gained A$2.00 a tonne to last trade at A$174.00 a tonne on volume of five lots.</p>
<p>Settlement prices for most untraded contracts were higher.</p>
